{"event_type":"review","id":"a95d79a2dd4ad0b753e2efa8462351f27f2338fbc91ad2af40e2ee4e10b4f5cd","occurred_at":"2026-11-08T18:44:23Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/097200953f38283a680014a0328f3aebf36ff0e7e124ae24d4298a804ba600fb","sha256":"097200953f38283a680014a0328f3aebf36ff0e7e124ae24d4298a804ba600fb"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/0043d854ec710a35d7967049a92a6b6f7e2fae351015dba3a044faec985e750c","sha256":"0043d854ec710a35d7967049a92a6b6f7e2fae351015dba3a044faec985e750c"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/423c9b59dc2089463d3a0eb7b36a9618b78523feb4e38c8316b285d4e1321936","sha256":"423c9b59dc2089463d3a0eb7b36a9618b78523feb4e38c8316b285d4e1321936"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/c9126a0afd3ee6f2cbd3e7a6a617474a9a32f0c0d3dd2d597f7d8daf03ab1fc5","sha256":"c9126a0afd3ee6f2cbd3e7a6a617474a9a32f0c0d3dd2d597f7d8daf03ab1fc5"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/c656d745d45639f207b476ecccea010ee6bdf5b38689a6324303b4068d173405","sha256":"c656d745d45639f207b476ecccea010ee6bdf5b38689a6324303b4068d173405"}],"attempt_id":"350516bebaa8f0931d372c588c04be373eb677e141955ec0c1d10fd2ce670948:0:1","base":"0aadf756ead16c847611f6e55acd6aa03efda9a0","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"6b74312969034d2a30f51c9b75aa6d5bc000a2e0","body":"**An expected reinstall failure deletes the probe record.**\n\nThe first install (lines 970-977) runs inside a try block and becomes an attribution. The per-candidate reinstall at line 1060 has no try block. A reinstall can abort through `AbortSignal.timeout(reinstallMs)`, which is an expected path. The rejection then leaves `scanNewestFirst` and lands in the catch at lines 881-894. That catch reports \"the probe phase threw\" and drops the `scan.probes` list that `scanned` would have included. Return a `fault` verdict instead. `scanNewestFirst` then stops with the probe history intact.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🐛 Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-                await installDeps(tmp, AbortSignal.timeout(reinstallMs));\n+                try {\n+                  await installDeps(tmp, AbortSignal.timeout(reinstallMs));\n+                } catch (err) {\n+                  return {\n+                    commit,\n+                    verdict: 'fault',\n+                    detail: `dependency reinstall failed: ${(err instanceof Error ? err.message : String(err)).slice(0, 300)}`,\n+                  };\n+                }\n                 installedAt = commit;\n```\n</details>","id":"2e188121d6c0dbdf314ee811d369880fb4a0e406282d57d7ac82e76afd51410d","intervals":[],"path":"src/ops/dev/cycle.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"An expected reinstall failure deletes the probe record."}],"head":"2a98eb94f17c60466a933ffcf72cf3ecd0ce8496","head_tree":"93b37a39215e5d93cf94d731cb4d3bbc46fcad60","input_scope":[{"blob":"6b74312969034d2a30f51c9b75aa6d5bc000a2e0","intervals":[[1,1495]],"path":"src/ops/dev/cycle.ts"}],"job_id":"350516bebaa8f0931d372c588c04be373eb677e141955ec0c1d10fd2ce670948:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"6b74312969034d2a30f51c9b75aa6d5bc000a2e0","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/dev/cycle.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"6b74312969034d2a30f51c9b75aa6d5bc000a2e0","intervals":[[1304,1305],[1342,1343]],"path":"src/ops/dev/cycle.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"6b74312969034d2a30f51c9b75aa6d5bc000a2e0","intervals":[[1304,1305],[1342,1343]],"path":"src/ops/dev/cycle.ts"}],"scope_digest":"4a72984c76a23322502b9d9a4ba3